message: "If you use this artifact, please cite it as below."
title: "HBS-PQ Research Artifact: Engineering Trade-offs in Merkle-Aggregated Winternitz Signatures"
abstract: >-
  From-scratch implementation and empirical audit of Lamport OTS, WOTS+/Winternitz,
  and Merkle-tree signatures, with known-answer tests, payload accounting, a repaired
  paired verification experiment, and a signer-state model.
